Chapter: AccpWasmAdmitTest
  cites Accp chapter AccpWasm
  cites Foreword chapter Console

Section: Fixtures

 Each module was assembled by wat2wasm from the WAT named in its label and
 encoded as base64; the admitted imports are wasi_snapshot_preview1 fd_read
 and fd_write typed (i32 i32 i32 i32) -> i32, at most one of each.

  row : Text, Text -> [Console] Nothing
  row (label) (b64) = print-line-uni (label & " " & (if ab-admit b64 then "admit" else "refuse"))

